      "description": "<h2 data-section-id=\"t1pm5u\" data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1130\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\">The Oak Ridge Boys – Room Service<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1299\"><strong data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1143\">Artist:</strong> The Oak Ridge Boys<br data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1165\">\n<strong data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1175\">Title:</strong> Room Service<br data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1191\">\n<strong data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1201\">Label:</strong> ABC Records<br data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1216\">\n<strong data-start=\"1216\" data-end=\"1235\">Catalog Number:</strong> AY-1065<br data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1246\">\n<strong data-start=\"1246\" data-end=\"1259\">Released:</strong> 1978<br data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1267\">\n<strong data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1278\">Format:</strong> 12\" Vinyl LP, Stereo</p>\n<p data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1406\">Original ABC Records pressing from 1978 featuring the Oak Ridge Boys before their biggest crossover hits.</p>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1bu1phi\" data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1426\">Tracks Include</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1619\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1xorp7y\" data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1452\">\nIf You Can't Find Love\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"if4qcp\" data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1463\">\nBut I Do\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"6qg8ie\" data-start=\"1464\" data-end=\"1485\">\nCallin' Baton Rouge\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1m39sgo\" data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1520\">\nIt Could Have Been Ten Years Ago\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"tpzwr0\" data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1541\">\nLots of Matchbooks\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"139zleo\" data-start=\"1542\" data-end=\"1556\">\nCryin' Again\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"jat25m\" data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1569\">\nCome On In\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"gbvopi\" data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1602\">\nLay Down Your Sword and Shield\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"i0aboe\" data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1619\">\nI Can Love You\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1621\" data-end=\"1624\">\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1uef3h1\" data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1639\">Condition</h3>\n<p data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1670\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1651\">Vinyl:</strong> VG+ (Visual Grade)</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1781\">\n<li data-section-id=\"dlarz9\" data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1701\">\nNice glossy playing surface\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1u310go\" data-start=\"1702\" data-end=\"1716\">\nClean labels\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"lo2ho2\" data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1745\">\nLight cosmetic sleeve wear\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"4y33uq\" data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1781\">\nNo obvious deep scratches visible\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1797\"><strong data-start=\"1783\" data-end=\"1793\">Cover:</strong> VG+</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1879\">\n<li data-section-id=\"46odw8\" data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1827\">\nLight edge and corner wear\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"t8vfmh\" data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1844\">\nMinor creasing\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ega4jp\" data-start=\"1845\" data-end=\"1879\">\nClean artwork with bright colors</li></ul>",
